# Site rework guardrails

- Preserve Astro 5 and Tailwind CSS 4. Do not migrate frameworks.
- Prefer `.astro` components and static rendering; add client JavaScript only when necessary.
- Do not add dependencies without explaining why.
- Do not change unrelated pages or styles.
- Reuse design tokens from `src/styles/global.css`.
- Meet semantic HTML and keyboard-accessibility requirements.
- Never invent metrics, testimonials, availability, client names, or project outcomes.
- Never include employer-confidential details or assets.
- Run the production build after each task and report changed files.
